SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Spotlight on NVIDIA models
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nNVIDIA models give developers optio
 ns for building and deploying AI workloads that require strong reasoning\,
  generation\, and accelerated inference across a range of application scen
 arios.\n\nJoin us as we explore NVIDIA models in Microsoft Foundry and see
  how they can be evaluated and used to build effective AI agents.\n---\n\n
 * Explore the Resources https://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays\n* Read
  the Newsletter https://aka.ms/model-mondays/newsletter\n* Continue the co
 nversation on the Discord https://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord\n\n[event I
 D:27577]
