SUMMARY:From Modernization to Innovation: Building AI-Ready Foundation for
  Your Business
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nModernizing an application is more 
 than moving it to the cloud—it creates the foundation for what comes nex
 t.\n\nIn this session\, we’ll take a modern application from cloud-nativ
 e architecture and GitHub-powered development workflows through to an AI-e
 nabled experience with Microsoft Foundry.\n\nAlong the way\, we’ll explo
 re how managed identity\, automation\, observability\, and cost-aware AI p
 atterns help you move from experimentation to scalable\, production-ready 
 innovation.\n--------------------------------------------------------\n\nC
 heck out the series - https://aka.ms/ModernizefasteSeries\n\n[eventID:2768
 6]
