SUMMARY:I Got Certified. Here’s What Happened Next. (Option 2)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nIs getting certified actually worth
  it? Let’s skip the certification pitch and ask the people who’ve actu
 ally done it. Why did they go for it? What did they get out of it? Did it 
 change their career\, their confidence\, or the opportunities in front of 
 them? And knowing what they know now\, would they do it again?\n\n📌 Thi
 s event is part of a series. Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/Fab
 ConRecap/y\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/U
 nderstandIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/
 ShowIt/y\n\n[eventID:27709]
