DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T120000
SUMMARY:Don’t Just Study. Prepare to Pass. (Option 1)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat does it really take to prepare
  for a certification exam? We go straight to people who’ve taken and pas
 sed exam after exam.\n\nWe’re talking study strategies\, favorite resour
 ces\, what’s actually worth your time\, what isn’t\, and the mistakes 
 they wouldn’t make twice.\n\nSteal their best strategies\, learn from th
 e mistakes they wouldn’t make twice\, and make whatever exam comes next 
 a little less painful and a lot more prepared.\n\nFor more information on 
 Data Days and all it has to offer\, visit https://aka.ms/DataDays\n\nExplo
 re certification resources at https://aka.ms/dd/Cert
