SUMMARY:Fabric IQ: Building the Context for Trusted AI (Option 2)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nAI is only as powerful as the conte
 xt behind it.\n\nExplore how Fabric IQ brings data\, business meaning\, an
 d context together to help AI better understand your organization and deli
 ver more relevant\, trusted experiences.\n\nSee what that looks like in ac
 tion and what it can unlock for the way we work with data and AI.\n\nFor m
 ore information on Data Days and all it has to offer\, visit https://aka.m
 s/DataDays\n\nExplore the official FabCon + SQLCon Barcelona recap at http
 s://aka.ms/dd/BCNRecap\n\n📌 This event is part of a series. Learn more 
 here: https://aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y
