SUMMARY:Governing IQ-Powered Agents in Production with Agent 365
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nLearn how to operate and govern IQ-
 powered agents in production with Agent 365. In this session\, we'll explo
 re the challenges that arise as agents move beyond development and into re
 al-world use\, including visibility\, policy enforcement\, and lifecycle m
 anagement.\n\nYou'll learn how Agent 365 works alongside the Microsoft IQ 
 stack to help organizations monitor\, manage\, and govern agents at scale 
 while maintaining trust\, security\, and operational control.\n\n---------
 ----------------------------------------\n🔗 Resources: https://aka.ms/i
 q-series\n\n📌 This event is a part of a series\, learn more here: https
 ://aka.ms/microsoftiqlive\n\n#MSFTReactor #learnconnectbuild #foundryiq #s
 erverless #knowledgebases #agentdevelopment #retrieval #datagrounding #azu
 reaifoundry #enterpriseknowledge
